This project is an inference engine and server for Inkling 2 Mini on the NVIDIA RTX 5090. It builds on the
following work.

satellitedown/inkling-2-mini-abliterated-ingine ("ingine", Apache License 2.0)
https://github.com/satellitedown/inkling-2-mini-abliterated-ingine
  The C++/CUDA engine that this project was measured and designed against: Blackwell Programmatic Dependent
  Launch overlap, the register-permuted tensor-core NVFP4 decode structure, DSpark adaptive speculative
  verify width with a CUDA-graph switch, and the grouped MoE prefill pipeline. assets/draft_vocab_32k.bin is
  built from ingine's draft_shortlist.bin (see scripts/build_draft_vocab.py).

tensorfish/squid5090 (Apache License 2.0, copyright 2026 tensorfish)
https://github.com/tensorfish/squid5090
  The Zig/CUDA engine whose kernel designs, launch order and parameter lists the Rust and cuda-oxide kernels in
  crates/inkling-kernels and the launch code in crates/inkling-engine were ported from.

NVIDIA cuda-oxide / cuda-rust (Apache License 2.0, copyright NVIDIA CORPORATION & AFFILIATES)
https://github.com/NVIDIA/cuda-rust
  The Rust-to-PTX compiler and runtime bindings used to build crates/inkling-kernels. Not included in this
  repository: clone it into third_party/cuda-rust to rebuild the kernels. patches/cuda-rust-windows-lean.patch
  is a small Windows fix for that checkout.

Inkling 2 Mini (Apache License 2.0, Thinking Machines)
https://huggingface.co/thinkingmachines/Inkling-2-Mini
  The model. The weights are not part of this repository and are downloaded separately.

CUDA components (cuBLAS and the CUDA runtime) keep NVIDIA's license terms.
